1
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:50,359
I killed someone just because you say so?

2
00:00:50,479 --> 00:00:51,759
She was my wife!

3
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,039
My wife and child are both dead,

4
00:00:54,039 --> 00:00:55,560
yet you falsely accuse me of murder!

5
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:56,880
This is completely absurd!

6
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,600
Absurd!

7
00:00:58,119 --> 00:00:59,359
Looking at Li Changyu right now,

8
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:01,280
who would believe he's the killer?

9
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,039
He looks so devastated

10
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:03,880
over losing his wife and child.

11
00:01:04,359 --> 00:01:05,359
The nanny mentioned before

12
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:06,640
that when Wu Qimeng was pregnant

13
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,680
and having mood swings,

14
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,519
he would drop to his knees to comfort her

15
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,040
and give in to everything she wanted.

16
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,920
In a normal, healthy marriage,

17
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,000
how could it ever be like that?

18
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,079
He's a senior executive.

19
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:19,319
He must be good with people.

20
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,200
He could have easily talked his wife down,

21
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,120
yet he chose to get on his knees and beg.

22
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,480
It proves

23
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:27,200
that his mind was already deeply twisted.

24
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,120
It wasn't out of love for Wu Qimeng;

25
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:32,040
it was endurance stripped of dignity.

26
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,599
So once his wife was no longer useful

27
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:36,760
and could no longer help him,

28
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:39,920
he struck with cold, ruthless resolve.

29
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:42,480
You really think I have no evidence?

30
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:44,519
Wang Lili has already confessed

31
00:01:45,319 --> 00:01:46,840
everything the two of you did.

32
00:01:49,159 --> 00:01:49,920
What are you talking about?

33
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,680
I don't understand.

34
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,359
When I left,

35
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:53,159
my wife was still alive.

36
00:01:53,239 --> 00:01:54,239
My nanny can testify to that.

37
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,560
Yes,

38
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,760
the nanny can prove

39
00:01:57,879 --> 00:01:59,040
she saw a living person,

40
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:05,280
but she can't prove

41
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,920
that person was Wu Qimeng.

42
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:08,840
What a joke!

43
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,479
I loved my wife so much.

44
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:11,599
What mistress?

45
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,000
Wang Lili is pregnant,

46
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:15,199
and you're doomed.

47
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,719
Even if she wouldn't do it for you,

48
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,960
she has to think of the child.

49
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,039
Doesn't she?

50
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,560
She also confessed

51
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,199
that you set the AC to 16 degrees.

52
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:24,800
She came back for two reasons:

53
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,919
one was to turn off the AC,

54
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,120
and the other

55
00:02:28,479 --> 00:02:29,919
was to schedule a timed text

56
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,240
to frame the courier.

57
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,159
You claim the person seen was

58
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:42,039
Wang Lili in disguise.

59
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:43,879
Yet you also claim

60
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,319
she only came over after dark.

61
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,479
If she really came in the afternoon,

62
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,840
do you have any proof?

63
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:52,560
All of this is nothing more

64
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,639
than wild speculation.

65
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:56,400
You have no hard evidence at all.

66
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:57,879
Besides,

67
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,840
I had no motive to kill her anyway.

68
00:03:28,719 --> 00:03:29,879
Li Changyu is a senior executive.

69
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,479
He embezzled for illegal investments,

70
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,199
totaling over ten million.

71
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,280
The reason it wasn't discovered earlier

72
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,080
was that Wang Lili

73
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,840
gave him money to cover the deficit.

74
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:40,439
This proves that

75
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,000
Li Changyu and Wang Lili

76
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,240
had a shady financial arrangement,

77
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,879
which is the main motive for the crime.

78
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,039
However,

79
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,840
we still lack crucial evidence.

80
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,360
The interrogation has hit a snag.

81
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,479
Wang Lili tricked the nanny as Wu Qimeng,

82
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,439
but the gate's security cameras

83
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,919
didn't capture her at all,

84
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:02,400
leaving no trace of entry or exit.

85
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,919
How did she manage that?

86
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:08,840
Li Changyu took Wu Qimeng to her checkup,

87
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,039
and Wang Lili is pregnant too.

88
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:12,919
It's very likely that at that point,

89
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:14,879
she slipped into his car

90
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,920
to enter the neighborhood.

91
00:04:17,879 --> 00:04:19,240
That reasonably explains her movements.

92
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:21,600
What about leaving?

93
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:22,879
If Wang Lili

94
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,480
remained hidden in Li Changyu's car,

95
00:04:25,079 --> 00:04:26,759
how did she escape the nanny's notice?

96
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,240
Thanks for your hard work today.

97
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,480
Let me give you a ride.

98
00:04:40,319 --> 00:04:41,279
All right, sir.

99
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,120
It's a suitcase.

100
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:53,120
Li Changyu is clever.

101
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,319
He's already realized

102
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,120
we don't have enough evidence.

103
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,079
He's stalling on purpose.

104
00:04:58,959 --> 00:05:00,160
We're running out of time.

105
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,199
What's done in the dark

106
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,720
comes to light.

107
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,319
Let's play a little

108
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,600
mind game with Li Changyu.

109
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:12,600
What?

110
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:14,360
Realized you wronged me

111
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,399
and letting me go?

112
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,519
Li Changyu,

113
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,759
male,

114
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:20,240
33 years old,

115
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,399
project manager at Sanshan Company.

116
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,519
On April 2nd,

117
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,240
you embezzled

118
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,279
two million from the company.

119
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,439
On May 18th,

120
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,079
you embezzled three million.

121
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,360
On June 20th, five million.

122
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:32,680
Ten million in total,

123
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,279
used for illegal personal investments.

124
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,120
This huge sum

125
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:38,759
faces an upcoming audit by the company.

126
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:40,720
If you can't pay it back next month,

127
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:42,439
you'll go to prison.

128
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:43,680
Isn't that right?

129
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,600
How did you...

130
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,160
get that authorization?

131
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:50,360
It took us a bit of time

132
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,279
to dig into your financial crimes.

133
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,800
Or we wouldn't have kept you waiting.

134
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,519
In such a short time,

135
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,199
how did you pull that off?

136
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,439
Li Changyu is only a department manager,

137
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,600
but if someone buys out his company,

138
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:09,120
wouldn't they have the authority

139
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,720
That way,

140
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,439
they could mandate a top-down

141
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:15,639
internal audit of the company?

142
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:18,160
Damn rich people.

143
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:20,160
Li Changyu,

144
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,480
You're a natural at living off a woman.

145
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,600
Must be nice spending Wang Lili's money.

146
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:27,560
You even had her use

147
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,560
other people's names to wire you money

148
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,399
to cover your deficit.

149
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,519
That money

150
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:35,399
has nothing to do with my wife's death.

151
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:36,800
Wang Lili wired it

152
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,920
because she wanted to.

153
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,839
There's nothing between us.

154
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:42,920
On the day of the murder,

155
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:45,120
after having sex with Wu Qimeng,

156
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:46,360
you strangled her to death

157
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,279
and hid her body.

158
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,240
The Wu Qimeng the nanny saw

159
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,720
was Wang Lili in disguise.

160
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:52,800
After that,

161
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,000
you had Wang Lili

162
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,560
hide in your trunk.

163
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,000
As for how she left,

164
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,879
When you headed to the airport,

165
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,680
the suitcase you carried

166
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,120
must have been pretty heavy, right?

167
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,519
The suitcase weighed

168
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,800
about 55 kilograms.

169
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,360
Right on the mark—

170
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,519
Wang Lili's exact weight.

171
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:14,000
Everything you've said

172
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,360
is nothing but speculation.

173
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:17,040
You don't have

174
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,959
any actual evidence.

175
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,639
This is the evidence.

176
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,560
From your suitcase,

177
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,079
we found biological evidence:

178
00:07:25,399 --> 00:07:27,120
Wang Lili's hair and skin tissue.

179
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,879
How did you open that suitcase?

180
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:35,600
Li Changyu took the bait.

181
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,120
Instead of questioning the evidence,

182
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,360
he's surprised

183
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,079
that his suitcase was opened.

184
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:45,879
You knew all along

185
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,199
Wang Lili would leave evidence inside.

186
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,240
Li Changyu,

187
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:52,480
to cover up your financial crimes,

188
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:54,560
you and your mistress Wang Lili conspired

189
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,519
to murder your wife, Wu Qimeng.

190
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:58,079
In your suitcase,

191
00:07:58,319 --> 00:08:00,079
we found Wang Lili's biological evidence,

192
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,160
excessive AC refrigerant,

193
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,800
plus that day's

194
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,199
abnormal power consumption as proof.

195
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,120
Wang Lili has confessed to everything.

196
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,639
What else do you have to say?

197
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,680
That's right.

198
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,519
I killed her.

199
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,399
She ruined me!

200
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,600
Had her family not opposed our marriage,

201
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,399
I never would've ended up like this!

202
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:28,600
She blocked my fortune,

203
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:30,000
wasted my youth,

204
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,800
and refused to give me a divorce!

205
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,759
She deserved to die! She deserved it!

206
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,559
How ridiculous.

207
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:40,000
A petty, venomous person like you...

208
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,799
What right do you have to blame

209
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,559
an innocent woman who gave up her wealth,

210
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,320
to end up losing both mother and child!

211
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:47,600
Yes,

212
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,279
Wu Qimeng made a mistake.

213
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:50,960
Her biggest mistake

214
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,120
was being blind enough to fall for you.

215
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:55,279
Li Changyu,

216
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:56,919
I am officially informing you

217
00:08:57,879 --> 00:08:59,360
that for the murder of Ms. Wu Qimeng,

218
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,919
you're under arrest by Ancheng police.

219
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:11,399
Blending truth with lies...

220
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:13,360
Can't believe you used your own hair

221
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,559
to fool Li Changyu.

222
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,039
Because what Li Changyu did was real.

223
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,480
His guilty conscience

224
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,399
made him slip up,

225
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,720
so he never questioned the hair.

226
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:24,559
And who was it earlier

227
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:26,480
who claimed to play strictly by the book?

228
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:29,120
That's called thinking on your feet.

229
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:30,919
Next, Lu Yuan and the team

230
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,080
will finalize the chain of evidence.

231
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,200
As for the rest,

232
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,240
let's leave it to Captain Lu and his team.

233
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,600
It's almost dawn.
